{"repositoryId":1116865749,"availability":"available","full":"Shubham126710/ODYSSEUS","name":"ODYSSEUS","description":"A modern news aggregator ","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-15T13:46:46Z","updated":"2026-10-12T10:00:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://odysseus-news.vercel.app","topics":["news","news-aggregator","rss-aggregator","rss-feed","rss-reader"],"demo":"https://odysseus-news.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:50.224Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:50.224Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:50.224Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:45:50.224Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The modern web is inundated with algorithmic rage-bait, aggressive newsletter popups, intrusive cookie walls, auto-playing video sidebars, and cluttered clickbait. Reading thoughtful, slow journalism has become an obstacle course.","Built as a tactile, ultra-premium living book, Odysseus merges the physical tactility of independent prestige print broadsides (The New Yorker, The Paris Review, Monocle, Wired, Bloomberg Markets) with cutting-edge web performance:"],"features":["Zero Noise: No author bylines, author bios, social follow cards, newsletter subscription boxes, or tracking pixels inside your articles. Pure narrative prose only.","Living Book Editorial Palette: Architectural warm parchment (#FAF7F0 / #F5F2EB), pressroom forest green (#243624 / #5D8246), cadmium orange accents (#FF6B4A), and deckle edge rules.","Strict Typographic Glyph Discipline: Zero emojis throughout all editorial interfaces. Replaced by timeless glyphs (✦, ◈, ◆, ❖, ⬡, —) and bespoke SVG vector monograms.","Resilient Media Architecture: Backed by an Edge Image Proxy and vector EditorialMonogramPoster fallback engine that guarantees zero broken cards or missing thumbnails across all feeds.","Mindful Habit Cultivation: Daily reading rhythm rewar